Package: dagmldata
Title: R Provider Bindings for dag-ml-data
Version: 0.2.11
Authors@R: person("G.", "Beurier", email = "beurier@cirad.fr", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Thin extendr bindings exposing the dag-ml-data in-memory provider
    (materialize, view, identity, target, feature, collation) to R as JSON in,
    JSON out. NIRS, ML and scheduling logic live in dag-ml-data / dag-ml.
